sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (index.html)
    participant A as FastAPI (main.py)
    participant V as Validator & Locks
    participant P as Preprocessing
    participant M as Model Singleton

    B->>A: POST /api/predict/{pipeline} (FormData)
    A->>V: Validate model_id, mode, MIME type, max_mb (400/413/415/422)
    V->>M: Acquire per-model threading.Lock() if uninitialized
    M-->>V: Return cached singleton predictor
    V->>P: Tokenize text / resize RGB image / sample <=8 MP4 frames
    P->>M: Forward pass (torch.no_grad(), CPU)
    M-->>A: Logits -> Softmax probabilities + prediction + confidence
    A-->>B: 200 OK JSON (adaptApiResult)
